Description: Clapshot with HTTP basic auth and htadmin user management
 Meta-package that configures Clapshot with HTTP Basic Auth
 and the htadmin PHP application for managing users (.htpasswd).
 .
 Installs nginx configuration, custom htadmin templates,
 and a postinst script that clones and configures htadmin.
